---
title: Southwest Chicken, Sweet Potato and Black Beans
source: claude
servings: 4
tags: [freezer, sheet-pan]
cook time: 25-35 minutes
---

> About 10 g fiber and 40 g protein per serving. If frozen, thaw before roasting.

Heat the oven to 425°F.

Toss @chicken thigh{2%lb}, @frozen sweet potato{3%cups}(cubes), @black beans{30%oz}(drained), @red bell pepper{1}(chopped) and @red onion{1}(cut into wedges) with @olive oil{2%tbsp}, @chili powder{2%tsp}, @ground cumin{1%tsp} and @salt{1%tsp}.

Spread on a #sheet pan{} and roast for ~{25-35%minutes}, until the chicken is cooked through.
